  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Raoul Wallenberg Institute Ukraina 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raoul Wallenberg Institute Ukraine 2025-2027 - RWI Ukraina 2025-27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xE4;rka Ukrainas infrastruktur f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter samtidigt som landets &#xE5;teruppbyggnad och EU-integreringsprocess st&#xF6;ds.

Projektet har&#xA0;f&#xF6;ljande&#xA0;tre&#xA0;m&#xE5;l:&#xA0;

- Ukrainas&#xA0;centrala&#xA0;institutioner&#xA0;genomf&#xF6;r&#xA0;strategier&#xA0;och&#xA0;policy f&#xF6;r&#xA0;m&#xE4;nskliga&#xA0;r&#xE4;ttigheter&#xA0;p&#xE5; ett effektivt&#xA0;s&#xE4;tt

- Akademiker och genomf&#xF6;rande akt&#xF6;rer tillf&#xF6;r expertis r&#xF6;rande m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter i samarbete med partner

- Ukrainas&#xA0;lokala&#xA0;partner i utvalda&#xA0;regioner&#xA0;bidrar, i h&#xF6;gre&#xA0;grad, till att&#xA0;realisera&#xA0;m&#xE4;nskliga&#xA0;r&#xE4;ttigheter och&#xA0;tillg&#xE5;ng&#xA0;till r&#xE4;ttvisa&#xA0;p&#xE5; lokal&#xA0;niv&#xE5;

M&#xE5;len kommer att uppn&#xE5;s genom &#xF6;kad kapacitet f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;rande av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter (MR) i praktiken, fr&#xE4;mjande&#xA0;av&#xA0;lokal&#xA0;MR-expertis&#xA0;samt att&#xA0;&#xF6;ka&#xA0;tillg&#xE5;ng&#xA0;till&#xA0;MR och&#xA0;r&#xE4;ttvisa&#xA0;p&#xE5; lokal, regional och&#xA0;nationell&#xA0;niv&#xE5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is that Ukraine&#x2019;s human rights infrastructure is strengthened while Ukraine&#x2019;s recovery and EU accession processes are supported. The Programme has three expected outcomes to achieve the objective:
1) Key Ukrainian institutions more effectively implement and monitor human rights strategies and policies in practice.
2) Ukraine&apos;s academics and practitioners increasingly provide human rights expertise in cooperation with other actors.
3) Ukraine&apos;s local actors in selected regions contribute, to a greater extent, to realizing human rights and access to justice at the local level.

The main strategies for achieving the objectives are:
1) Increasing capacities to apply human rights in practice.
2) Fostering local human rights expertise.
3) Expanding outreach on human rights and access to justice at multiple levels.</narrative>
  </description>
